DETAIL: Aggregates with DISTINCT must be able to sort their inputs.

> select array_agg(distinct xmin) from uo
ERROR 42883: could not identify an ordering operator for type xid (at 27)
DETAIL: Aggregates with DISTINCT must be able to sort their inputs.

> select count(distinct cmin) from uo
ERROR 42883: could not identify an ordering operator for type cid (at 23)
DETAIL: Aggregates with DISTINCT must be able to sort their inputs.

> select xmax from uo order by xmax
